<title>NETHERLANDS: Standard Federal Bank - key facts.</title>
<headline>Standard Federal Bank - key facts.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch bank ABN AMRO Holding NV gave the following information about Standard Federal Bancorporation Inc. which it plans to acquire for $1.9 billion:</p>
<p>Headquarters in Troy, Michigan. Principal subsidiary Standard Federal Bank has 182 branches in states of Michigan, Illinois, Ohio and Indiana. Employs some 4,000 people. Has approximately one million clients to which it mainly sells saving products and residential mortgages. At end of October 1996 Standard Federal had total assets of $15.5 billion and shareholders' equity of some $900 million.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
